'''Silver Traveler's Axe''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife that was awarded to the player that finished '''2nd''' in the [[Halloween Event 2023]] Leaderboard.

==Appearance ==
It looks exactly like [[Traveler's Axe]], but with a silver texture instead of the regular texture.

==Trivia==
*Other variants of this include [[Gold Traveler's Axe]], [[Bronze Traveler's Axe]], and [[Red Traveler's Axe]].
*This item is a silver reskin of the [[Ancient Weapons|godly]] knife [[Traveler's Axe]].
*Like all other [[Unique Weapons|unique weapons]] (excluding [[Corrupt]]), this item is [[Trading|untradable]].
*The sole owner of this knife is [https://www.roblox.com/users/105726567/profile '''Slain_xz'''].
